    <string name="device_info_body">XISEM-Find · Find model\nFrom the manual for this model.\n\nConnection\n2.4 GHz Wi-Fi · IEEE 802.11 b/g/n\n\nBattery &amp; charging\n250 mAh · USB Type-C\nRated input: 5 V / 1 A\nRated charging time: about 60 minutes\nRated operating time: about 90 minutes\nActual duration varies with use.\n\nCamera &amp; body\nCMOS sensor · 3.5 mm lens diameter\nBody: 14 mm diameter × 150 mm long\nWeight: 16.2 g\n\nCare (from the manual)\nDo not use while charging or immerse the device in liquid. Gently wipe the lens with a cotton swab.\n\nManual ratings do not indicate the current app image quality, frame rate or remaining runtime.</string>
